{{#> layout
  title='How to Use AI as a Language Learner'
  metaDescription='Ask ChatGPT, Gemini, or Claude your everyday questions in the language you are learning. Get replies plus grammar corrections. Ready-made prompt inside.'
  url='/ai.html'
  ogImage="ai.png"
  ogDescription='Turn any popular AI into your language teacher.'
  navbarAlwaysMurky=true
  navbarSpacing="mb-0"
  navbarContainerClass="container-md"
  noCta=true
  nonStickyNavbar=true
}}
  <style>
    :root {
      --info-radius: 0.75rem;
      --info-padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .select-language {
      border-radius: var(--info-radius);
      border: none;
      box-shadow: none;
      padding: var(--info-padding);
      background-position: right var(--info-padding) center;
    }

    .info-panel {
      padding: var(--info-padding);
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--info-radius);
    }

    .info-panel[hidden] {
      display: none;
    }

    .source-note {
      font-size: 80%;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .setup-section {
      background: #f9f9f9;
    }

    .setup-section .header{
      color: var(--bs-body-color);
      font-size: 140%;
    }

    #prompt-wrapper {
      font-size: 90%;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;

      #prompt {
        display: block;
      }

      #copy-button {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: var(--info-padding);
        right: var(--info-padding);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        font-size: 90%;
      }
    }

    #ai-tabs {
      .ai-tabs-nav {
        gap: 0.25rem;
        padding: 0.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        background: #ececec;
        border-radius: var(--info-radius);
      }

      .ai-tab {
        flex: 1 1 0;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--bs-secondary-color);
        border-radius: calc(var(--info-radius) - 0.25rem);
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition:
          background-color 0.15s ease,
          color 0.15s ease,
          box-shadow 0.15s ease;
      }

      .ai-tab:hover {
        color: var(--bs-body-color);
      }

      .ai-tab[aria-selected='true'] {
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--bs-body-color);
        box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      }

      .ai-tab .ai-logo {
        width: 1.15em;
        height: 1.15em;
        opacity: 0.55;
        transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
      }

      .ai-tab:hover .ai-logo,
      .ai-tab[aria-selected='true'] .ai-logo {
        opacity: 1;
      }

      .ai-instruction {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .bi-box-arrow-up-right {
        font-size: 0.85em;
        margin-left: 0.35em;
      }
    }
  </style>
  <div class="container-md">
    <div class="pt-3 pb-5">
      <h1 class="h3">How to Use AI as a Language Learner</h1>

      <p>If you're an A2+ language learner who wants to try using AI in your target language, you're probably wondering:</p>

      <blockquote class="call-out">What if I make a mistake? How would I even know?</blockquote>

      <p>To solve this problem, I created a universal prompt that you can add to ChatGPT, Gemini, or Claude. With it, the assistant doesn't just help you — it also evaluates and corrects your grammar.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="setup-section">
    <div class="container-md py-5">
      <p class="h5 header" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">Follow these 3 steps to set it up</p>

      <p>Works with ChatGPT, Gemini, and Claude.</p>

      <p class="fw-bold">1. Which language are you learning?</p>

      <select id="language" name="language" aria-label="Language" class="select-language form-select form-select-sm mb-4">
        {{#each htmlWebpackPlugin.options.environment.languages}}
          <option value="{{this.code}}">{{this.label}}</option>
        {{/each}}
      </select>

      <p class="fw-bold">2. Select and copy this global prompt.</p>

      <pre class="info-panel" id="prompt-wrapper" style="font-size:80%;"><code id="prompt"></code><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" id="copy-button"><i class="bi bi-copy"></i><span>Select and Copy to Clipboard</span></button></pre>

      <p class="fw-bold">3. Add the copied prompt to your AI assistant's context.</p>

      <div id="ai-tabs" class="mb-4">
        <div class="ai-tabs-nav d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row" role="tablist" aria-label="AI assistant">
          <button
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            class="ai-tab"
            id="ai-tab-chatgpt"
            data-ai-tab="chatgpt"
            aria-controls="ai-panel-chatgpt"
            aria-selected="true"
            translate="no"
          ><img class="ai-logo" src="assets/chatgpt.svg" aria-hidden="true" alt="" width="24" height="24" />ChatGPT</button>
          <button
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            class="ai-tab"
            id="ai-tab-gemini"
            data-ai-tab="gemini"
            aria-controls="ai-panel-gemini"
            aria-selected="false"
            tabindex="-1"
            translate="no"
          ><img class="ai-logo" src="assets/gemini.svg" aria-hidden="true" alt="" width="24" height="24" />Gemini</button>
          <button
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            class="ai-tab"
            id="ai-tab-claude"
            data-ai-tab="claude"
            aria-controls="ai-panel-claude"
            aria-selected="false"
            tabindex="-1"
            translate="no"
          ><img class="ai-logo" src="assets/claude.svg" aria-hidden="true" alt="" width="24" height="24" />Claude</button>
        </div>

        <div
          class="info-panel"
          role="tabpanel"
          id="ai-panel-chatgpt"
          data-ai-panel="chatgpt"
          aria-labelledby="ai-tab-chatgpt"
        >
          <p class="ai-instruction">Paste the prompt into the <strong translate="no">Custom instructions</strong> section of <a
              href="https://chatgpt.com/#settings/Personalization"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="link-secondary"
              translate="no"
            >ChatGPT Personalization<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="info-panel"
          role="tabpanel"
          id="ai-panel-gemini"
          data-ai-panel="gemini"
          aria-labelledby="ai-tab-gemini"
          hidden
        >
          <p class="ai-instruction">Open <a
              href="https://gemini.google.com/saved-info"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="link-secondary"
              translate="no"
            >Gemini personal context<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>, tick the <strong translate="no">Your instructions for
              Gemini</strong> checkbox, then click <strong translate="no">+ Add</strong> and paste the prompt.</p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="info-panel"
          role="tabpanel"
          id="ai-panel-claude"
          data-ai-panel="claude"
          aria-labelledby="ai-tab-claude"
          hidden
        >
          <p class="ai-instruction">Paste the prompt into the <strong translate="no">Instructions for Claude</strong> section of your <a
              href="https://claude.ai/settings/profile"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="link-secondary"
              translate="no"
            >Claude profile<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-md py-5">

    <p>Not gonna lie, it will be a bit difficult at the beginning. You will have to compose yourself to write your prompts to AI in a more-or-less sane way. But the more you do it, the better and easier it becomes.</p>

    <div class="hide-ios hide-android">
      <p>I have also created browser extensions that play out with this method extremely well.</p>

      <style>
        .extensions {
          display: flex;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .install-extension-button {
          --bg-color: #2c2c2c;
          --bg-hover-color: #000;

          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 0.5rem;
          padding: 0.65rem 1rem 0.65rem 3rem;
          border-radius: 2rem;
          font-size: 0.9rem;
          font-weight: 200;
          color: #fff;
          text-decoration: none;
          box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
          transition: background-color 0.2s ease-in-out;

          &.chrome {
            background: var(--bg-color) url('assets/chrome.svg') 0.5rem center no-repeat;
            background-size: 1.8rem;
          }

          &.safari {
            background: var(--bg-color) url('assets/safari.svg') 0.5rem calc(50% + 0.05rem) no-repeat;
            background-size: 1.9rem;
          }

          &:hover {
            background-color: var(--bg-hover-color);
          }
        }
      </style>
      <div class="mb-4 extensions">
        <a class="install-extension-button chrome" href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/vocably/baocigmmhhdemijfjnjdidbkfgpgogmb">
          Chrome Extension
        </a>
        <a class="install-extension-button safari" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/vocably-for-safari/id6464076425">
          Safari Extension
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-5">
      {{> social-share
        page="ai.html"
        cta="Share this method with your friends"
      }}
    </div>
  </div>
{{/layout}}
